{"server":"cn","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_st02","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_st02","title":"启圣","storyCode":"MT-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"34aafe27191cf3dc2161a6dac22d70aa2ce939556ce57a31bed159e7db9d3366","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，执行者先生，所以你压根没想过将阿尔图罗小姐带回兰登修道院？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有表达过这样的意图。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就带她回兰登修道院了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还需要借助阿尔图罗确认一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，不能这样欺负一位修女哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凯莱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，不就是在告解车面前开了你两句玩笑，至于跑那么快吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么玩笑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好吧......总之，我知道这个通缉犯的事情很棘手，所以特意带了人来支援你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是特意放弃了去观摩降生仪式的机会，感动吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并未向公证所申请任何形式的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我知道，你甚至没怎么和其他执行者一起行动过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你以为我想掺和啊，这可是教皇厅七个分厅联合发布的特别行动指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我接到通讯的时候吓了一跳......搞得我以为阿尔图罗蛊惑你一起叛国了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有此类倾向，她也不具备这个能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"评估完毕，教皇厅的风险预期可以排除。执行者里凯莱，请现在带人返回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没理解错的话，你拒绝了特别行动指令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你没有拒绝的权利哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接到的任务是——降生仪式开始前，监督费德里科将阿尔图罗缉拿归案，如果这两人有任何异动，便将他们一同带回！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还太早，执行者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗小姐，你是在对我说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来之后，我一直待在修道院里，好不容易出来一趟，还不想那么早回去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有十多年没看过圣城一点点沉入夜色了......这里的视野很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是要负隅顽抗了......真是的，又要加班了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳修女，请躲到我们身后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，接下来交给你指挥吧。长久以来，重大通缉犯阿尔图罗都是你在负责，你最熟悉她的种种手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来拉特兰一直在注视着你呢，费迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"举起你的铳吧，反正你不是第一次这么做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿尔图罗站在天台的边缘，费德里科还有许多问题要问她，但他注意到对方的手指已经抚上了琴弦。\n越过她，费德里科看到了高不见顶的育婴圣堂，和络绎不绝拥向其中的人群。\n里凯莱和其他同僚站在自己身后，费德里科听见了武器上膛的声音。\n场面变得微妙起来，好像作为执行者的自己突然需要去证明些什么。\n几乎没有思考的时间，费德里科举起了守护铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗，你对自己的越狱行为供认不讳，我代表公证所，正式重启对你的危险评估与抓捕程序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应履行拉特兰公民之义务，配合我们解除拉特兰之风险。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有任何征兆，费德里科的守护铳喷吐出火舌。\n同一个瞬间，大提琴的声音如流水般倾泻，与育婴圣堂方向传来的赞歌声融为一体，淹没了天台上的异响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是精准射击你们身侧的建筑物，并没有瞄准你们本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，好疼......*拉特兰俚语*，我脑袋被石头砸了......是不是出血了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你最好清楚自己在做的事情意味着什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是出血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情结束后，我会提交详细的任务报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......包括对你头部受伤细节的解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真果断啊，执行者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，你要怎么处理这晕了一地的人......你在搜什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凯莱的身上有告解车的年卡，给那些载具设定好目的地后，它们可以送这些人到医院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，向我同步你的发现，配合我解除拉特兰之风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是猜测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一路追过来，又选择将自己的同僚送离这里，说明你已经有了和我相同的猜测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间快到了，费迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许这座城市很快便会告诉我们，它到底发生了什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库兰塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还从来没在拉特兰见过这么多异族人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次万国峰会的时候，其他国家的来宾加起来也没有凑满一个宾馆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教皇厅几乎所有的枢机都到场了......人真多啊，比大教堂的氛围更让人不自在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个位置已经够偏了，莫斯提马。我们就像两个在轮盘赌场外等着擦地板的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓的降生仪式，无非就是安多恩待会儿把刚学会说话的萨科塔小孩抱出来，再由那边的牧首象征性地为他“擦亮光环”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是一个噱头罢了，不如回家看《独臂电锯侠2》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就当为了看看保育员安多恩是怎么工作的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你该跟他说的话不都已经说过了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道为什么，从刚才开始，总感觉心脏有点不舒服......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，莫斯提马，你感受到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亚梅塔侧过头去，好友的表情变得前所未有地严肃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像在为什么事情感到紧张......不，是焦虑，是恐惧，是一些没有来由的兴奋，又有些期待......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说不上来，心跳好像都不是自己的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是共感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个堕天使，一个黎博利，我们都没这能力。不对，不止我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亚梅塔的目光扫过周围，她终于确定那心跳不是幻觉。\n她此刻感受到的种种情绪同样正写在周围人的脸上，在场的每一人都在随那不属于自己的心跳声而悸动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看头顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些安抚铃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亚梅塔顺着好友的视线看过去。\n降生仪式开始后，所有的门窗都已关闭，没有一丝风吹进来。\n但无论是在她们身处的启圣大堂，还是在连通育婴室的走廊，安抚铃明明在有规律地晃动着，却并未发出应有的清脆声响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一种媒介......像是莱塔尼亚人爱鼓捣的那些音乐装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我猜得没错，我们正在感受的，是那位正在分娩的母亲的心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一模一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我妻子生产的时候，我就等在产房外，处境跟现在一模一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能清晰感受到她当时承受着多强烈的疼痛，但她不愿意放弃，她的情绪牵动着我，我们一起呼唤着之前为孩子取好的名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“贝利、贝利......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位母亲，刚刚是晕过去了吗？她太虚弱了，分娩的痛苦已经超出她现在能承受的极限——情、情况非常不乐观！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的心脏都快要跳出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，她还不想放弃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎博利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主啊，主，洁白无瑕的圣城，请护佑我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁珀&库兰塔&菲林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请护佑我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请护佑我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这确实算是一种......“共感”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"narration","text":"整个圣堂的安抚铃激烈地摇晃着，心跳声毫无规律，那变幻的情绪攥紧了所有人的神经。\n无一人知道那位母亲是谁，她叫什么名字，她多大年纪，她来自何处......但所有人都知晓她在经历什么，无一人挪动脚步。\n脆弱的新生还未战胜死亡，从蒙昧中破壳似乎遥遥无期。育婴圣堂内，数千人正在共同经历一场分娩——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉特兰本不该存在如此清晰的共感。\n良久，良久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那心跳声渐渐弱了下来，直至归于平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"连上这根遥感线，启动计时器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最后一颗炸弹......搞定！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，这个心跳声......真的很难忍住不去感同身受啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏我有着企鹅物流最好用的脑子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是能一边左手玩《唱片大亨》，一边右手玩光铳射酒瓶游戏，同时赢了老板和德克萨斯的超人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么长的时间，不是白练的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒计时，两分钟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要炸毁这截走廊，通向那间育婴室的路就全断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望老姐的情报没有错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"育婴圣堂从移动修道院里找来了一位萨卡兹孕妇，还特地办了个所谓的仪式，让她在万国峰会上生下萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道这帮人的目的是什么，但只要不让她出现在大家面前，就能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让一下好吗，别堵在这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个母亲马上就要分娩了，我想靠近点，为她祈祷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我这就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......孕妇......那不就是你吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"添头","speakerId":"avg_npc_1807_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你不是应该正在分娩——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪乐，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的姐姐曾经带着你来我家里玩，我们见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，菲亚梅塔的爷爷，您好——啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣堂巡卫们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特里奇昂阁下，剩下的人正在搜索炸弹，并逐一排除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住这个萨科塔，她身上还有更多爆炸物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣堂巡卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心。远程单位已就位，如果嫌犯逃跑，我们会当场狙杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿摩斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1783_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特里奇昂阁下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安枢机，你来迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将嫌犯带回第七厅吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，如果降生仪式不是为这个萨卡兹准备的，那......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知不觉间，那响遍整个圣堂的心跳声已经安静了下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"某道走廊的深处，一扇门打开了。能天使循声望去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"保育员怀抱着小小的襁褓，站在门前洞开的光亮里。他的双手和袍袖满是血污，但襁褓是干净的。\n他眉眼低垂，缓步走向启圣大堂，走向焦急等待的牧首，人群自觉为他让出一条路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"牧首接过保育员递过来的新生儿。她目不能视，没能看见对方眉眼间深锁的悲悯。\n牧首轻轻揭开了襁褓，那幼小的生命露出了真容——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一只幼兽。\n他靠在牧首的肩头，那包裹着稚嫩腿爪的黏膜还未完全褪去，湿漉漉皱巴巴的毛发没有舒展的迹象。\n他紧闭着眼睛，呼吸几不可闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如各位所见，育婴圣堂建成后，接生的第一个生命，是一只木攀兽的幼崽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他轻若无物，可又有着令人敬畏的重量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来到拉特兰之前，我在一座废弃的移动修道院偶然发现了他的母亲——骨瘦如柴，羽毛脱落，我几乎没能认出那是一只木攀兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"猎人的长枪贯穿了母兽的腰腹，只是毫厘之差，没有伤及其中的胎儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道这孩子的母亲是如何躲开人群藏匿了许久，怎么维生，又是怎样强忍着重伤和饥饿保持清醒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直至今日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感谢这位坚强的母亲，也感谢各位萨科塔与黎博利同胞，以及远来的异族的客人们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子在我们所有人的祈愿中降生，他是你们共同创造的奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但为何......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为何他迟迟不愿睁开眼睛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧首，这孩子的呼吸已经越来越微弱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了很多办法，他的母亲，也已经拼尽全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是母体受伤太重，这孩子在孕育期间没有汲取到足够的营养，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，或许我们所有人都忽略了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的分娩过程漫长而煎熬，可是通过安抚铃，从始至终，我们只共感到一个心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这孩子太过脆弱，甚至无法表达自己求生的渴望，那本应是生命最原始的呼喊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安多恩低垂着眉眼，不再言语。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，你有想到降生仪式是这样的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照往常的流程，这会儿早就该围着嗷嗷大哭的孩子分蛋糕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的，这也太令人难过了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两人的意思是，那个妈妈那么努力，最后只生下来了一个死胎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这*叙拉古粗口*的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们、我们还能做些什么吗？就像刚刚几千人一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢想，如果当时守在产房外的自己，经过几小时漫长的等待后，没有感应到小贝利的心跳......我和我的妻子该怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，我不敢再往下想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的孩子，如果你能听见我的呼唤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群中传来了极低的啜泣声。\n继而，越来越多的人再也无法控制住自己的情绪，哭声连缀成一片，在空旷的圣堂中回荡......为一个可怜的母亲，为一个夭折的婴儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一声哭声响起。\n那声音并不悲伤，它稚嫩而嘹亮。\n仿佛是感应到了人们的情绪，木攀兽幼崽睁开了眼睛，发出生命中第一声呐喊。与此同时，他舒展着肢体，毛发奇迹般变得丰盈。\n牧首忍不住抱紧了怀中的生命，喜极而泣。一滴泪从她眼罩后空洞的眼眶中滑落，落在幼兽的头顶，折射出太阳的光亮。\n幼兽的哭声未停，那点光亮像是被哭声催动，一点点从虚空中褪去束缚，变得圆满——\n光环。\n萨科塔的印记，律法的彰显，真理的具象，此刻，它点亮了这个陌生的族类——\n熠熠生辉，仿佛奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主再一次回应了我们的期待，祂选择为这个孩子赐福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是千年难遇的圣迹。灾异当前，它的出现，是律法给予我们的启示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们每一人都见证了它，我们每一人都参与了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此后，以这座圣城为始，以这座圣城为终，我们生而平等，我们生而为一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——作为萨科塔。"},{"type":"narration","text":"牧首的怀中，那年幼的生命此刻正在舔舐牧首的手臂，他已经彻底苏醒。\n安抚铃再一次无风自动，强健的心跳声席卷了整座育婴圣堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉特兰向一只木攀兽的幼崽分享了光环？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕《圣徒行记》里最夸张的奇观，也很难和眼前的景象相提并论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费迪，你说这是一种神圣的赐福，还是一种可怖的灾异？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更在意的是，它是否真实可信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是从什么时候开始怀疑眼前的一切的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有太多细节，阿尔图罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行踪诡异的告解车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无边的麦田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遭到严格管控的铳械与炸药制造，被全面关停的铳械工坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然间变更了职能的兰登修道院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行政体系大变的教皇厅，突然强力干涉我调查的同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凯莱对我的行动并不知情，却能在最关键的时刻带队前来，帮助我确认了自己的判断，否则我仍会对你动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种种异象的终点，便是眼前仿佛横空出世的育婴圣堂，和这场万众期待的降生仪式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你在移动修道院追查的失踪的母亲，其实是那只怀孕的木攀兽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的琴声与她的心声偶然交错，随后我一路追来这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起上述种种，真正影响我判断的是——对这一切浑然不觉的拉特兰人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活的方方面面明明都发生了天翻地覆的变化，但这个国家、这座城市仍在有序地运行着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当六百万拉特兰人都在以如常的姿态生活，我们很难说服自己，唯有我们自己在保持清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费迪，对你这样的死脑筋来说，这种自我怀疑真是难得的经历啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，此时此刻，你确定了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数学、物理、地理、考古学、天文学......从现有科学的任何角度，以及神学和哲学的任何理论，都无从解释......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存在一种力量，能让一座六百万人口的城市陷入群体性的幻觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但眼前的情形，已与拉特兰的秩序、律法的根基彻底背道而驰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再无疑惑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真巧啊，我也是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g8_catastrophicsquare"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
